@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Create a job
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobType": "ImportCsv",
  "payload": "{\"file\": \"data.csv\"}"
}

###

### Get job status (replace the GUID with an actual job ID)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###
